rgins of the specimen. The specimen is submitted from anterior to posterior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing the anterior and posterior margins of the specimen, respectively. The margins are taken en face and radially sectioned.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  through  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  do not contain full thickness sections of the specimen. The specimen is submitted entirely. Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION 
