E IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION (FISH) FOR HER-2/NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast (Left, block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ): HER-2/neu gene in tumor cells: REMOVED_DATE (Not Amplified). See note. Note: Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER-2 signals (94) to chromosome 17 signals (94) in 60 tumor cell nuclei. A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID /neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis. Results at or near the cutoff point (ranging from REMOVED_DATE - 2.2) should be interpreted with caution. Addendum #2 by Elena F Brachtel M.D., Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 21,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06:28:18PM By his/her signature above, the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. PART A: Breast (Left), Excision PART B: Lymph Node (Left Axilla, "Sentinel"), Excision PART C: Breast (Left, Final Margin inferior), Excision PART D: Breast (Left, Final Margin superior), Excision PART E: Breast (Left, Final Margin medial), Excision PART F: Breast (Left, Final Margin lateral), Excision [report_end] 
