esion that is located at the inked resection margin. Entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Gross Dictation by Rema A Rao M.D., B.S., on REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by Rema A Rao M.D., B.S., on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (RIGHT MEDIAL ), EXCISION PART B: BREAST (RIGHT INFERIOR LATERAL), EXCISION PART C: BREAST (RIGHT SUPERIOR MEDIAL DEEP), EXCISION 
