e localizing clip. The entire specimen is \u000asequentially submitted, with tissue containing clip in micro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , and \u000aperpendicular ends in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Entire specimen, sequentially, multi frags, ESS. \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_CASE_ID . \u000adb\u005cpab \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Lucian R Chirieac M.D., Electronically signed on \u000a11/15/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
