ea of hemorrhage with a \u000asmall cavity (0.3cm ) in the fibrous tissue. The specimen is entirely \u000asubmitted. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  entire specimen, 8 frags, ESS. \u000amir \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
