tive sections are submitted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Entire hemorrhagic area #1, submitted with overlying posterior margin taken radially.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Entire hemorrhagic area #2 with overlying posterior margin taken radially.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Representative sections of fibrous parenchyma sequentially submitted from one aspect to the opposing. Received fresh, labeled "217 right sentinel node", are two rubbery tan-pink lymph nodes with attached fat measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm  The smallest lymph node is submitted in toto in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the largest bivalved in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Amendment #1 by Kristina Braaten M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (LEFT), SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B: LYMPH NODE (LEFT AXILLA, "SENTINEL"227), EXCISION PART C: LYMPH NODE (LEFT AXILLA, "SENTINEL"55), EXCISION PART D: BREAST (RIGHT), SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART E: LYMPH NODE (RIGHT AXILLA, "SENTINEL"217), EXCISION [report_end] 
